sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis session
    participant API as Interview service
    participant Graph as Interview StateGraph
    participant Q as Question agent
    participant F as Feedback agent
    participant S as Summary agent
    participant LLM as ChatGroq
    participant DB as MongoDB
    UI->>GW: POST /api/interview/start
    GW->>Redis: Validate session
    Redis-->>GW: Session identity
    GW->>API: Proxy + x-user-id
    API->>Graph: invoke(action=start, role, type, resume)
    Graph->>Q: Route START to interviewAgent node
    Q->>LLM: Prompt for HR/technical questions
    LLM-->>Q: Question JSON text
    Q-->>Graph: Parsed question list
    Graph-->>API: Questions
    API->>DB: Create interview record
    DB-->>API: Interview ID and saved questions
    API-->>UI: First question and interview ID
    loop Each submitted answer is a separate HTTP request
        UI->>GW: POST /api/interview/answer
        GW->>Redis: Validate session
        Redis-->>GW: Session identity
        GW->>API: Proxy + x-user-id
        API->>DB: Load interview and current question
        DB-->>API: Interview state
        API->>Graph: invoke(action=feedback, answer, completed, questions)
        Graph->>F: Run feedbackAgent node
        F->>LLM: Evaluate question and answer
        LLM-->>F: Feedback JSON text
        F-->>Graph: Parsed feedback
        alt Last question completed
            Graph->>S: Conditional edge to summaryAgent
            S->>LLM: Summarize questions, answers and previously attached feedback
            LLM-->>S: Final report JSON text
            S-->>Graph: Parsed report
        else More questions remain
            Graph-->>API: Feedback only
        end
        Graph-->>API: Feedback and optional report
        API->>DB: Save answer, feedback, progress and optional report
        API-->>UI: Feedback and next question or completed report
    end
